WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.091
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:01.361 --> 00:02.629
(This drama merged facts with fiction and plots may differ from records.)

3
00:02.696 --> 00:03.964
(Children and animals were filmed with the aid of guardians and experts.)

4
00:04.030 --> 00:05.031
(Some scenes were made using generative AI.)

5
00:10.670 --> 00:13.874
As long as I live,

6
00:14.641 --> 00:18.111
no one shall ever...

7
00:22.716 --> 00:25.719
invade Goguryeo!

8
00:45.672 --> 00:47.874
It is a rebellion!

9
01:40.393 --> 01:42.329
Protect His Majesty!

10
02:17.697 --> 02:18.698
Oh, my!

11
02:21.434 --> 02:23.036
How dare you!

12
03:44.217 --> 03:45.418
Where are you going?

13
04:21.988 --> 04:25.358
Gae So Mun, you bastard!

14
04:27.427 --> 04:30.130
Your Majesty, you must leave immediately.

15
04:30.663 --> 04:31.698
Think only...

16
04:32.565 --> 04:33.800
of Goguryeo.

17
05:20.246 --> 05:24.050
Dismiss Kim Chun Chu and behead him.

18
05:24.517 --> 05:29.189
- Behead Kim Chun Chu. - Behead Kim Chun Chu.

19
05:29.255 --> 05:33.293
- Behead Kim Chun Chu. - Behead Kim Chun Chu.

20
05:33.793 --> 05:36.429
- Behead Kim Chun Chu. - Behead Kim Chun Chu.

21
05:36.496 --> 05:37.797
(Kim Beop Min, eldest son of Kim Chun Chu)

22
05:37.864 --> 05:40.233
General Kim Yu Sin has arrived.

23
05:40.300 --> 05:41.768
(Bi Dam, minister of Silla, a Jingol)

24
05:48.441 --> 05:50.743
(Kim Yu Sin, Supreme General of Silla)

25
05:53.112 --> 05:54.948
(Kim Jin Ju, minister of Silla, a Jingol)

26
06:05.091 --> 06:06.159
Your Majesty.

27
06:06.893 --> 06:10.663
Those who disobey their monarch and cause a rift...

28
06:10.730 --> 06:12.465
are not worthy to have Silla blood.

29
06:13.132 --> 06:16.936
Behead those who go against you, uphold law and order within,

30
06:17.537 --> 06:19.706
and prepare to fight Baekje.

31
06:48.067 --> 06:49.135
Your Majesty.

32
06:49.869 --> 06:52.672
Your disloyal servant is returning in three years.

33
06:57.143 --> 06:58.278
General.

34
06:58.344 --> 07:01.547
As if leaving your post on the Goguryeo border was not bad enough,

35
07:01.881 --> 07:04.584
you have now abandoned the front to bring your troops to Seorabeol.

36
07:05.885 --> 07:09.255
Who sent you word to leave the border?

37
07:09.322 --> 07:11.925
Know your place!

38
07:12.792 --> 07:16.362
I am a general who serves the command of Her Majesty.

39
07:19.766 --> 07:23.436
Your Majesty, I left my main army at the Goguryeo border...

40
07:23.703 --> 07:25.772
and traveled here with six men.

41
07:26.205 --> 07:29.208
And it is because I foresaw this very situation.

42
07:31.277 --> 07:35.214
The Minister of Military Affairs' duty is to execute those who retreat.

43
07:35.281 --> 07:37.984
Baek Ryong had come to relay important information.

44
07:39.819 --> 07:43.323
If we cannot behead Baek Ryong, who left his fortress and caused a rift,

45
07:44.857 --> 07:46.893
what of the soldiers outside?

46
07:47.660 --> 07:50.730
Anyone who defends Baek Ryong is an accomplice.

47
07:51.631 --> 07:54.067
Silla's greatest threat does not come from the outside,

48
07:54.934 --> 07:57.136
but from the division within.

49
07:58.104 --> 08:00.974
While my men give their lives to hold the border,

50
08:01.040 --> 08:03.643
the Jingol nobles in the capital...

51
08:04.110 --> 08:08.214
sat idly and refused to send their own troops to war!

52
08:10.583 --> 08:12.518
If anyone serves their own interests above Silla's...

53
08:12.919 --> 08:14.954
and causes internal division,

54
08:15.488 --> 08:17.757
do they not deserve to be beheaded?

55
08:20.927 --> 08:22.328
Your Majesty.

56
08:22.395 --> 08:25.999
If you believe Silla's future depends on eliminating those of Gaya descent,

57
08:27.000 --> 08:29.335
I ask that you kill me and my men first.

58
08:31.037 --> 08:33.906
Though these men scorn me for my Gaya blood,

59
08:34.207 --> 08:40.413
I have risked my life in battle to prove my loyalty to Silla.

60
08:41.614 --> 08:43.016
My men outside...

61
08:43.683 --> 08:46.919
have Gaya blood in their veins...

62
08:47.487 --> 08:49.022
but have fought for Silla for over ten years.

63
08:49.922 --> 08:52.458
They were not even aware of their heritage!

64
08:55.361 --> 08:58.398
If we must die to save Silla,

65
08:59.932 --> 09:02.301
then we will willingly give our lives here.

66
09:20.920 --> 09:23.723
This is my command as Ruler of Silla.

67
09:24.690 --> 09:28.027
Kim Chun Chu will remain Minister of Military Affairs...

68
09:28.094 --> 09:30.630
and guard Daeyaseong Fortress.

69
09:31.330 --> 09:32.999
As for you, General Kim Yu Sin,

70
09:33.433 --> 09:36.502
take 3,000 cavalry from Seorabeol...

71
09:37.070 --> 09:39.272
and take up position outside the capital.

72
10:05.832 --> 10:09.535
(Episode 2: A Fortress of Madmen)

73
10:10.336 --> 10:12.205
(Taiji Palace, Chang'an, Tang Dynasty)

74
10:14.974 --> 10:18.177
Li Shiji, Commander of the Shuozhou Expeditionary Army,

75
10:18.244 --> 10:21.147
has returned after conquering Xueyantuo.

76
10:21.214 --> 10:24.217
Your Majesty's territory...

77
10:24.283 --> 10:27.520
now stretches 3,735km from east to west,

78
10:27.587 --> 10:32.191
and 4,288km from north to south.

79
10:33.025 --> 10:38.631
- We hail the conqueror of the world. - We hail the conqueror of the world.

80
10:40.099 --> 10:42.135
(Li Shimin, Emperor of Tang)

81
10:43.202 --> 10:46.672
(Goguryeo)

82
11:06.792 --> 11:09.028
The map shows there are other nations.

83
11:09.729 --> 11:11.430
So how can I say that I have conquered the world?

84
11:15.201 --> 11:16.335
Your Majesty.

85
11:16.869 --> 11:19.138
If you were to give me 30,000 men,

86
11:19.539 --> 11:21.841
I will take Liaodong and Pyongyangseong...

87
11:22.241 --> 11:24.577
and bring you the head of Goguryeo's king.

88
11:25.111 --> 11:26.112
Your Majesty.

89
11:26.179 --> 11:27.213
(Zhangsun Wuji, Tang's minister)

90
11:27.280 --> 11:28.648
Goguryeo is cold and barren,

91
11:28.714 --> 11:31.350
and the people are known to be fierce and violent.

92
11:31.417 --> 11:34.153
They are not worth the effort of conquering.

93
11:41.027 --> 11:42.962
Is there ever an exception to conquering?

94
11:43.229 --> 11:46.199
Emperor Yang of Sui lost a million men in Goguryeo...

95
11:46.265 --> 11:48.601
and brought about his dynasty's fall.

96
11:49.302 --> 11:52.838
Do not underestimate Ko Geon Mu, who defeated Emperor Yang.

97
11:53.272 --> 11:58.044
On top of that, there are too many strong fortresses.

98
11:58.411 --> 12:01.414
(Sui)

99
12:08.187 --> 12:10.323
Because Emperor Yang failed,

100
12:10.990 --> 12:12.358
you believe I will fail also?

101
12:13.859 --> 12:16.395
You think I cannot beat Ko Geon Mu?

102
12:16.462 --> 12:17.763
That is preposterous!

103
12:18.598 --> 12:23.469
You united the realm and subjugated nations without suffering a defeat.

104
12:23.536 --> 12:27.106
I would not dare compare you to the ruler of a fallen dynasty.

105
12:27.607 --> 12:28.641
I merely mean...

106
12:29.075 --> 12:31.510
that Goguryeo is cold and useless...

107
12:31.577 --> 12:32.645
Zhangsun Wuji!

108
12:39.952 --> 12:43.522
Your Majesty, Grand Preceptor Wei Zheng is entering.

109
12:55.268 --> 12:57.570
(Wei Zheng, Tang's Grand Preceptor)

110
13:00.940 --> 13:02.508
Your Majesty.

111
13:03.976 --> 13:05.211
I miss the days...

112
13:05.778 --> 13:07.013
when you and I,

113
13:07.713 --> 13:10.916
with Li Shinji and Zhangsun Wuji,

114
13:11.851 --> 13:15.288
raided and conquered the Western Regions...

115
13:16.322 --> 13:19.058
and the northern lands.

116
13:24.230 --> 13:26.666
We can still share more victories.

117
13:27.199 --> 13:28.868
Ko Geon Mu of Goguryeo...

118
13:29.735 --> 13:31.470
fears you, Your Majesty.

119
13:31.871 --> 13:34.540
He voluntarily destroyed the monuments at the border...

120
13:34.607 --> 13:36.542
and strives to preserve peace with us.

121
13:36.609 --> 13:39.645
Therefore, Goguryeo is as good as yours now.

122
13:40.613 --> 13:41.814
Your Majesty.

123
13:42.114 --> 13:46.152
Many men from Shandong Province were conscripted for war,

124
13:46.686 --> 13:49.155
so the region still suffers.

125
13:49.722 --> 13:53.059
If you attack Goguryeo when it has already submitted,

126
13:53.859 --> 13:56.629
you may obtain more land...

127
13:57.763 --> 14:00.533
but risk the resentment of an exhausted people.

128
14:01.767 --> 14:04.670
However, if you were to find cause to conquer Goguryeo...

129
14:04.737 --> 14:07.506
after our people had time to recover,

130
14:08.507 --> 14:10.242
your people and your ministers...

131
14:10.776 --> 14:14.613
will willingly give their lives for you.

132
14:18.217 --> 14:19.552
I am aware...

133
14:20.419 --> 14:22.822
that I do not have long to live.

134
14:25.458 --> 14:27.293
But when the time comes to mobilize,

135
14:29.328 --> 14:30.529
I will assist you...

136
14:32.264 --> 14:33.999
in your endeavors...

137
14:35.234 --> 14:36.769
from the afterlife.

138
14:57.656 --> 15:00.092
I know the depth of your loyalty.

139
15:05.331 --> 15:06.732
I will bide my time.

140
15:08.868 --> 15:12.505
- We thank you, Your Majesty. - We thank you, Your Majesty.

141
15:15.040 --> 15:16.409
Zhangsun Wuji.

142
15:17.276 --> 15:20.780
Follow Wei Zheng's counsel and focus on the people's recovery.

143
15:21.547 --> 15:22.548
Meanwhile,

144
15:23.416 --> 15:25.518
all commanders, including Li Shiji,

145
15:25.818 --> 15:28.521
are to train and prepare for a future war.

146
15:28.587 --> 15:30.790
- Yes, Your Majesty. - Yes, Your Majesty.

147
15:40.399 --> 15:42.935
(Goguryeo)

148
16:16.469 --> 16:18.137
(Ko Yeon Mu, Goguryeo's general)

149
16:18.537 --> 16:19.805
(Ko Geon Mu, 27th ruler of Goguryeo)

150
16:23.075 --> 16:25.044
Has Pyongyangseong...

151
16:25.945 --> 16:27.012
finally fallen?

152
16:28.247 --> 16:29.515
We cannot be certain...

153
16:30.583 --> 16:32.051
from this distance.

154
16:49.268 --> 16:50.302
- Your Majesty. - Your Majesty.

155
16:54.340 --> 16:55.741
Are you all that remain?

156
16:55.808 --> 16:56.842
(Seondo Hae, Goguryeo minister)

157
16:58.544 --> 17:02.815
Your Majesty, retreat to Liaodong and bide your time.

158
17:03.482 --> 17:06.886
Ko Jeong Eui's Central Army lies in ambush near Sasu.

159
17:07.453 --> 17:08.554
I will join them.

160
17:11.357 --> 17:12.791
But Ko Jeong Eui and the Central Army...

161
17:13.359 --> 17:15.027
(Ko Jung San, Goguryeo's general)

162
17:15.094 --> 17:16.896
They have sided with Yeon Gae So Mun.

163
17:17.429 --> 17:18.430
What?

164
17:20.132 --> 17:21.467
Ko Jeong Eui...

165
17:23.168 --> 17:24.303
betrayed me?

166
17:25.137 --> 17:26.405
Please head to Liaodong.

167
17:26.872 --> 17:29.241
Our fortresses there still stand strong.

168
17:29.308 --> 17:32.511
There, you can escape Yeon Gae So Mun.

169
17:39.652 --> 17:41.253
I will go to Pyongyangseong.

170
17:43.589 --> 17:45.591
My men are there.

171
17:46.625 --> 17:48.127
Not even Yeon Gae So Mun...

172
17:50.029 --> 17:53.132
could have taken Pyongyangseong.

173
17:55.067 --> 17:56.835
You must go to Liaodong.

174
18:11.383 --> 18:12.851
Pyongyangseong...

175
18:14.620 --> 18:15.721
is where I will go.

176
19:35.901 --> 19:37.569
Welcome, Your Majesty.

177
19:38.837 --> 19:39.838
(Ko Juk Ri, Western Commander)

178
19:39.905 --> 19:41.106
Give His Majesty a warm welcome!

179
20:01.827 --> 20:03.028
Make way!

180
20:07.733 --> 20:08.967
I will clear the path.

181
20:57.116 --> 20:59.485
- Surrender. - Release me!

182
20:59.551 --> 21:01.787
Let me go, you traitors!

183
21:01.854 --> 21:02.888
Release me!

184
21:02.955 --> 21:04.456
(Geom Mo Jam, Goguryeo's general)

185
22:01.280 --> 22:05.584
Your Majesty!

186
22:48.861 --> 22:50.462
Do you think...

187
22:51.163 --> 22:53.966
this will make the world yours?

188
22:55.667 --> 22:56.668
Escort the King.

189
24:20.118 --> 24:21.219
(Ah Jin Ham, Kim Yu Sin's loyal servant)

190
24:21.286 --> 24:22.921
Daeyaseong is not far from here.

191
24:39.671 --> 24:43.942
- Will you be going to Tang, In Mun? - Yes.

192
24:44.009 --> 24:45.210
That is good news.

193
24:45.610 --> 24:47.379
You must see a bigger world.

194
24:50.215 --> 24:54.486
I never thought we would be drinking together here in Seorabeol.

195
24:59.558 --> 25:00.692
How is the tea?

196
25:00.926 --> 25:04.196
I had it prepared specially for you.

197
25:05.497 --> 25:07.165
If you had not appeared when you did,

198
25:07.232 --> 25:10.102
our father would have been in great trouble.

199
25:10.168 --> 25:11.336
Thank you, Uncle.

200
25:12.938 --> 25:15.941
How do you think I knew to come?

201
25:16.174 --> 25:17.175
Pardon?

202
25:18.276 --> 25:20.979
"Things are brewing on the Baekje border."

203
25:21.046 --> 25:24.883
"Bi Dam and his cohorts will most definitely plot something."

204
25:25.517 --> 25:29.488
Your father warned me in advance.

205
25:30.188 --> 25:31.189
Father.

206
25:31.790 --> 25:34.292
They will not be able to use our Gaya ancestry...

207
25:34.826 --> 25:36.895
against us for a while.

208
25:43.001 --> 25:44.002
Beop Min.

209
25:47.039 --> 25:49.775
What is your ultimate goal?

210
25:52.644 --> 25:54.413
It is time you wielded a sword...

211
25:55.280 --> 25:56.948
for your country.

212
26:26.611 --> 26:27.746
(Baekje, the enemy)

213
26:27.813 --> 26:30.582
This place belonged to Gaya, then to Baekje.

214
26:30.816 --> 26:33.218
And now it belongs to Silla.

215
26:33.785 --> 26:35.987
These people merely lived their lives on this land.

216
26:36.421 --> 26:38.190
Once, they were Gaya people.

217
26:38.757 --> 26:40.292
Yesterday, they were Baekje people.

218
26:40.759 --> 26:42.994
Today, they are the people of Silla.

219
26:44.329 --> 26:47.766
Officials think they will betray Silla easily,

220
26:48.266 --> 26:50.469
so they leave these terrifying warnings.

221
26:52.104 --> 26:54.773
Was this General Kim Pum Seok's doing?

222
26:54.840 --> 26:58.410
Any general of Silla would do the same.

223
26:59.211 --> 27:00.612
If Baekje were to take over again,

224
27:01.012 --> 27:02.547
its people would do so as well.

225
27:03.982 --> 27:05.617
If there is a living hell,

226
27:06.618 --> 27:08.253
this would be it.

227
27:45.457 --> 27:46.491
Father.

228
27:50.495 --> 27:52.397
- You sensed it too? - Yes.

229
27:54.332 --> 27:56.868
- Which direction? - Behind us to the right.

230
27:57.435 --> 27:59.271
There are not many of them.

231
28:01.239 --> 28:02.474
Watch your back.

232
28:08.847 --> 28:09.881
Who goes there?

233
28:10.982 --> 28:12.017
Show yourself!

234
28:17.856 --> 28:20.692
I am Kim Chun Chu, Silla's Minister of Military Affairs.

235
28:21.960 --> 28:24.963
I am on the way to see Kim Pum Seok, the lord of Daeyaseong.

236
28:25.964 --> 28:27.999
If you do not wish to fight us,

237
28:29.034 --> 28:30.468
show yourselves.

238
28:32.504 --> 28:34.272
You are going to see Kim Pum Seok?

239
28:36.608 --> 28:37.609
Yes.

240
28:38.343 --> 28:39.644
We are not the enemy.

241
28:40.946 --> 28:42.714
We are Silla men, the same as you.

242
28:44.583 --> 28:46.952
You are going to Kim Pum Seok, yet claim you are not the enemy?

243
28:48.353 --> 28:49.621
If you stand with him,

244
28:50.622 --> 28:52.624
you are murderers as well.

245
29:10.942 --> 29:11.943
Father.

246
29:38.303 --> 29:40.772
If you were wronged, I will avenge you.

247
29:42.340 --> 29:45.410
If Kim Pum Seok is guilty of something, I will uncover the truth.

248
29:46.978 --> 29:48.446
Show yourselves!

249
29:50.915 --> 29:52.917
I swear it on my name.

250
30:35.293 --> 30:38.396
Will you please hear our plight?

251
30:41.299 --> 30:43.168
Lord Kim Pum Seok...

252
30:43.868 --> 30:48.039
called my mother a spy just because she was of Baekje descent.

253
30:49.841 --> 30:50.842
Look at her now.

254
31:13.064 --> 31:16.401
I, Kim Pum Seok, just saved your life.

255
31:20.205 --> 31:21.639
Welcome, sir.

256
31:22.140 --> 31:23.375
Hello, Beop Min.

257
31:25.310 --> 31:29.114
Welcome to Daeyaseong, the front line of Silla.

258
31:37.889 --> 31:40.024
(Sabiseong, Baekje)

259
31:52.570 --> 31:54.072
Still no news from Daeyaseong?

260
31:55.774 --> 31:58.777
We have taken 40 fortresses in Daeya Province.

261
31:58.843 --> 31:59.978
(King Uija, 31st ruler of Baekje)

262
32:00.044 --> 32:03.314
Why have we not heard any good news yet?

263
32:04.816 --> 32:08.420
It is the strongest fortress in all of Silla.

264
32:08.987 --> 32:12.791
We know so little of the situation within its walls.

265
32:16.494 --> 32:17.762
First, you blamed our shortage of men.

266
32:18.329 --> 32:19.831
Then, you blamed Kim Yu Sin.

267
32:20.598 --> 32:22.667
Now you blame a lack of intelligence?

268
32:23.768 --> 32:25.537
Do you plan to leave Daeyaseong...

269
32:26.004 --> 32:28.239
and make a detour to Seorabeol?

270
32:33.011 --> 32:34.345
It has been 100 years.

271
32:35.413 --> 32:36.848
King Seong lost his life...

272
32:38.316 --> 32:41.453
to those Silla barbarians 100 years ago!

273
32:45.089 --> 32:46.758
It has been a whole century.

274
32:48.893 --> 32:50.495
The dogs...

275
32:51.830 --> 32:53.565
broke our alliance,

276
32:54.098 --> 32:55.099
betrayed King Seong,

277
32:55.934 --> 32:58.937
and took his head as a trophy of war.

278
33:00.305 --> 33:03.641
They still control our Dangseong and Daeyaseong.

279
33:05.176 --> 33:07.045
I have yet to avenge my ancestor.

280
33:09.647 --> 33:10.715
How am I to bear...

281
33:12.951 --> 33:14.085
this humiliation?

282
33:23.094 --> 33:25.430
I will bleed the people of Silla dry...

283
33:25.930 --> 33:29.400
and paint Wolseong Palace red with their blood.

284
33:30.902 --> 33:32.570
I will scatter their bones...

285
33:33.304 --> 33:35.707
across the kingdom.

286
33:35.773 --> 33:38.877
Until I do that, I do not think I can say...

287
33:40.578 --> 33:42.447
I have done my duty.

288
33:44.549 --> 33:45.984
With my own hands,

289
33:48.520 --> 33:50.855
I will tear out that queen's heart.

290
33:55.293 --> 33:56.928
Only then will I sleep in peace.

291
34:06.371 --> 34:07.372
My dear ministers.

292
34:13.745 --> 34:14.846
As usual,

293
34:16.814 --> 34:18.750
you are silent.

294
34:22.153 --> 34:23.655
Then I will go...

295
34:24.822 --> 34:26.491
topple Daeyaseong myself.

296
34:27.859 --> 34:29.060
Your Majesty!

297
34:29.928 --> 34:32.030
I will stake my life upon...

298
34:32.564 --> 34:36.868
destroying Daeyaseong within three days!

299
34:36.935 --> 34:39.270
- Your Majesty! - Your Majesty!

300
34:39.904 --> 34:42.340
I will go!

301
34:42.407 --> 34:45.543
Please send me!

302
34:46.678 --> 34:47.946
Your Majesty.

303
34:56.988 --> 34:58.489
(Baekje)

304
34:58.556 --> 35:00.091
(Silla)

305
35:12.804 --> 35:15.373
(Daeyaseong, Silla)

306
35:24.649 --> 35:26.651
(Kim Go Ta So, Kim Pum Seok's wife, Kim Chun Chu's daughter)

307
35:41.032 --> 35:42.700
Grandpa!

308
35:53.277 --> 35:54.278
My dear child.

309
35:55.279 --> 35:57.382
You have grown a great deal.

310
36:00.618 --> 36:03.021
The baby looks just like you, Go Ta So.

311
36:04.989 --> 36:05.990
Yes.

312
36:07.225 --> 36:10.595
The Baekje army was nearby. Were you in any danger?

313
36:12.130 --> 36:13.131
Not at all.

314
36:13.965 --> 36:15.500
We got here safely, as you can see.

315
36:18.269 --> 36:19.871
Is that true, Beop Min?

316
36:21.305 --> 36:23.141
I did not see any Baekje soldiers.

317
36:26.110 --> 36:27.879
Then I am glad.

318
36:28.579 --> 36:29.847
Welcome.

319
36:40.091 --> 36:41.092
Come on!

320
36:44.295 --> 36:45.296
Let us go inside.

321
37:06.150 --> 37:09.353
You could have sent me...

322
37:10.054 --> 37:13.691
to Seorabeol instead of Kim Yu Sin.

323
37:13.758 --> 37:15.860
You are the governor of Daeya Province.

324
37:17.061 --> 37:18.996
You are at the front lines...

325
37:19.464 --> 37:22.266
and hold the most important duty of defending us from Baekje.

326
37:22.333 --> 37:23.534
True.

327
37:24.535 --> 37:27.138
I know very well that I must defend Seorabeol.

328
37:28.639 --> 37:33.511
But I am sick and tired of all that defending.

329
37:34.479 --> 37:36.380
It has been four years.

330
37:39.217 --> 37:41.352
Staying behind the walls to defend a province?

331
37:44.322 --> 37:46.791
My wife would be better at it.

332
37:52.396 --> 37:53.431
Well...

333
37:54.432 --> 37:57.702
As you know, my husband led the Battle of Okmungok to victory.

334
37:57.769 --> 38:00.138
He is a warrior at heart.

335
38:04.108 --> 38:09.080
I am still washing the blood from that battle from my hands.

336
38:10.948 --> 38:12.049
Yes.

337
38:13.050 --> 38:16.521
If it were not for you, Bi Dam would be dead.

338
38:18.523 --> 38:21.492
I saved Bi Dam at Okmungok...

339
38:23.528 --> 38:26.764
and almost died at the hands of a Baekje soldier.

340
38:30.134 --> 38:31.135
So why...

341
38:33.337 --> 38:36.007
does this fortress I risked my life for...

342
38:37.441 --> 38:40.011
seem so insignificant?

343
38:42.780 --> 38:44.215
My dear father-in-law,

344
38:47.385 --> 38:48.519
why did you save me...

345
38:49.554 --> 38:51.956
by exchanging prisoners of war?

346
38:58.496 --> 39:00.665
I am tired, so I will retire for the night.

347
39:30.661 --> 39:34.332
Only you two can put me in a good mood.

348
39:53.050 --> 39:54.252
- Spare me! - Please!

349
39:54.318 --> 39:55.453
- Help! - Please spare me!

350
39:55.519 --> 39:57.388
- Free me! - Let us go!

351
39:57.455 --> 39:58.990
- Please! - Spare me!

352
39:59.056 --> 40:00.291
Spare my life.

353
40:00.358 --> 40:02.059
Please do not kill me.

354
40:04.061 --> 40:05.663
Speak up or die!

355
40:06.397 --> 40:08.499
Save us, General.

356
40:08.566 --> 40:10.101
- Please! - Save us!

357
40:11.435 --> 40:13.804
General, please save us.

358
40:14.205 --> 40:15.339
Kill me.

359
40:17.441 --> 40:18.943
Execute the Silla men.

360
40:20.177 --> 40:21.512
General! Save us!

361
40:24.615 --> 40:26.183
Save us, General.

362
40:26.851 --> 40:29.720
They just want to know the way to Seorabeol.

363
40:30.121 --> 40:32.924
The road that only you know!

364
40:33.190 --> 40:34.692
Tell them...

365
40:35.059 --> 40:37.194
so we can live!

366
40:37.929 --> 40:40.898
Help us, General!

367
41:05.523 --> 41:08.492
You wench. You are a Baekje spy.

368
41:08.893 --> 41:10.628
You must be here to hand me over to them.

369
41:15.299 --> 41:16.300
General!

370
41:17.668 --> 41:18.769
How dare you?

371
41:19.670 --> 41:21.706
Do you have a death wish?

372
41:23.874 --> 41:24.875
No, General.

373
41:31.182 --> 41:33.250
You have a Baekje wife.

374
41:34.151 --> 41:36.420
Did you throw her out?

375
41:36.487 --> 41:38.089
(Geom Il, Silla's official)

376
41:39.023 --> 41:40.024
Yes, sir.

377
41:40.391 --> 41:41.392
I did as you commanded.

378
41:42.860 --> 41:44.028
Your wife...

379
41:45.062 --> 41:47.131
was a great beauty.

380
41:48.766 --> 41:50.968
What a waste.

381
41:54.038 --> 41:55.272
Her misfortune...

382
41:56.774 --> 41:58.342
was being from Baekje.

383
42:27.438 --> 42:28.773
Help us.

384
42:29.173 --> 42:32.043
Help us. Get us out of here.

385
42:32.910 --> 42:35.146
- Please. - Save us.

386
42:35.546 --> 42:36.947
Save us.

387
42:37.014 --> 42:39.950
- Please help. - Get us out of here!

388
42:40.017 --> 42:41.519
- Help me. - Save my life.

389
42:41.585 --> 42:44.155
My family will starve without me!

390
42:46.157 --> 42:49.260
My lord! Will you please save me?

391
42:49.493 --> 42:52.096
Kim Pum Seok will kill us tomorrow!

392
42:52.163 --> 42:55.232
We do not have long to live!

393
42:57.968 --> 42:59.737
Please...

394
43:44.381 --> 43:45.649
What is all this?

395
44:19.150 --> 44:20.518
Not bad.

396
44:20.584 --> 44:23.087
I thought you could not even hold a sword.

397
44:25.156 --> 44:26.957
Is that why you attacked me from behind?

398
44:27.424 --> 44:29.994
Why do you lock up and kill the innocent?

399
44:30.060 --> 44:31.929
Do you believe what they say?

400
44:32.496 --> 44:35.199
Those Baekje wretches lie with every breath.

401
44:35.733 --> 44:39.136
They will shoot us in the back the moment they are free!

402
44:39.837 --> 44:41.238
Are you so afraid of Baekje?

403
44:42.706 --> 44:44.375
Only a weakling would say that.

404
44:44.441 --> 44:47.044
Then release them beyond the gates.

405
44:48.212 --> 44:49.813
If you keep seeking revenge,

406
44:50.281 --> 44:52.516
they will seek vengeance in return.

407
44:55.486 --> 44:59.223
What do you know of war?

408
45:00.291 --> 45:02.359
I know the reasons we lose.

409
45:04.094 --> 45:05.729
A fortress built on hatred...

410
45:06.530 --> 45:08.199
is bound to fall.

411
45:12.836 --> 45:14.338
A fortress of hatred?

412
45:18.442 --> 45:19.543
I see now.

413
45:20.411 --> 45:22.046
Did your father...

414
45:22.379 --> 45:24.081
send you to test me?

415
45:25.182 --> 45:27.151
My father is not like you!

416
45:33.057 --> 45:34.325
Take your father...

417
45:35.726 --> 45:37.795
back to Seorabeol soon.

418
45:39.096 --> 45:41.565
The reason I did not tell my father of your true nature is...

419
45:43.334 --> 45:44.969
that Go Ta So asked me not to.

420
45:46.036 --> 45:48.372
I held my tongue because this fortress will stand...

421
45:49.306 --> 45:51.008
even with a fool like you in charge.

422
45:52.543 --> 45:54.612
However, if you continue with this tyranny,

423
45:56.080 --> 45:57.915
you will lose this position as well.

424
46:12.429 --> 46:14.865
(Pyongyangseong, Goguryeo)

425
47:37.281 --> 47:38.282
Please sit.

426
47:43.687 --> 47:44.722
Your Majesty.

427
47:46.290 --> 47:50.561
Is this truly what you want?

428
47:56.800 --> 47:58.402
Thirty years ago,

429
47:59.303 --> 48:03.173
Emperor Yang of Sui attacked Goguryeo with a million men.

430
48:03.607 --> 48:06.877
His commander, Lai Hu'er, led an army of 40,000,

431
48:06.944 --> 48:11.081
yet you beat him with just 500 men and saved Pyongyangseong.

432
48:13.117 --> 48:16.487
The great Ko Geon Mu!

433
48:19.456 --> 48:20.824
Then how...

434
48:21.892 --> 48:25.929
have you become a king who breaks his people's hearts...

435
48:25.996 --> 48:28.031
by humiliating yourself,

436
48:28.098 --> 48:33.470
destroying war monuments, and sending your son as a pledge of peace?

437
48:51.955 --> 48:53.490
That is your throne.

438
48:54.825 --> 48:58.862
Apologize to your people and announce your alliance with me.

439
48:59.663 --> 49:03.534
Then I will let you sit there again.

440
49:04.134 --> 49:05.936
You fool!

441
49:07.404 --> 49:12.309
Li Shimin and his empire are nothing like the Sui Empire.

442
49:13.143 --> 49:14.778
Your reckless behavior...

443
49:15.412 --> 49:16.914
will bring unrest to Goguryeo,

444
49:16.980 --> 49:20.517
and the people's resentment will tear you to shreds.

445
49:20.584 --> 49:22.119
You are wrong!

446
49:23.754 --> 49:28.091
Hiding like a timid rat for fear of war...

447
49:28.158 --> 49:32.329
only invites invasion and brings war to our doorstep.

448
49:32.396 --> 49:35.199
That is how you will condemn our people to death.

449
49:36.333 --> 49:41.738
Why must our people hide behind fortress walls?

450
49:42.372 --> 49:43.507
If we lack land,

451
49:44.141 --> 49:48.011
I will take land that belongs to others.

452
49:48.745 --> 49:50.514
If anyone is starving,

453
49:51.148 --> 49:53.650
I will steal food to feed them.

454
49:54.251 --> 49:56.119
You have managed to manipulate and entice...

455
49:56.687 --> 49:59.823
the nobles and commoners with your wicked schemes.

456
50:25.282 --> 50:26.884
Years ago,

457
50:27.618 --> 50:30.888
your ancestor, King Yangwon,

458
50:31.655 --> 50:33.924
reached far north during his reign.

459
50:35.592 --> 50:36.760
Now that I think about it,

460
50:37.628 --> 50:43.400
the descendants of those traitors are all gathered here.

461
50:44.568 --> 50:46.770
Our people shed their blood...

462
50:47.538 --> 50:50.541
while the traitors' descendants...

463
50:51.208 --> 50:54.177
lived in luxury for generations.

464
50:54.778 --> 50:58.549
The common people's blood and tears are what defended Goguryeo,

465
50:59.816 --> 51:06.657
yet these men act like they alone protected this kingdom from Sui.

466
51:07.224 --> 51:08.392
That is what you...

467
51:09.726 --> 51:11.061
and these fools have done.

468
51:12.329 --> 51:13.931
I see.

469
51:14.831 --> 51:17.801
You are consumed by your insecurities.

470
51:18.769 --> 51:22.940
Do you covet the throne of the man who defeated Sui?

471
51:31.148 --> 51:34.351
If you defeated Sui,

472
51:34.918 --> 51:39.756
then I, Yeon Gae So Mun, will crush the arrogant Tang!

473
51:39.823 --> 51:42.726
I cannot let a delusional fool like you...

474
51:43.460 --> 51:45.829
bring Goguryeo to ruin.

475
51:48.599 --> 51:49.766
Is that so?

476
52:10.821 --> 52:11.822
Give him a sword.

477
52:23.100 --> 52:24.501
All of you, leave!

478
52:26.069 --> 52:27.571
Stay and watch.

479
52:29.406 --> 52:30.841
I will strike anyone...

480
52:32.242 --> 52:33.644
who averts their eyes.

481
52:48.959 --> 52:52.462
He is a valuable servant of Goguryeo!

482
52:53.330 --> 52:56.366
More like a useless stray dog.

483
52:56.433 --> 52:58.402
How dare you!

484
53:33.236 --> 53:34.638
You bastard!

485
54:24.187 --> 54:25.455
Such loyalty.

486
54:51.314 --> 54:53.884
Must I hand Goguryeo over...

487
54:54.851 --> 54:56.987
to this madman?

488
54:58.555 --> 55:02.926
Do you not fear heaven's judgment?

489
55:20.811 --> 55:22.512
Gae So Mun.

490
55:23.980 --> 55:27.250
Wielding a sword does not make you powerful.

491
55:28.785 --> 55:30.520
A truly powerful man...

492
55:32.455 --> 55:34.191
waits for the right time to fight.

493
55:35.625 --> 55:36.893
He holds back.

494
55:37.761 --> 55:39.429
He knows how to be patient.

495
55:40.463 --> 55:42.666
A man who protects his people...

496
55:44.234 --> 55:46.269
is a true hero.

497
55:48.572 --> 55:50.640
Do not sacrifice Goguryeo...

498
55:52.609 --> 55:54.511
for the sake of your ambition.

499
55:57.047 --> 55:58.281
Protect Goguryeo...

500
56:01.685 --> 56:03.653
and its people...

501
56:07.490 --> 56:08.658
to the very end.

502
56:11.027 --> 56:12.128
In the name...

503
56:13.930 --> 56:15.799
of the young hero...

504
56:20.570 --> 56:22.072
who prevailed over Sui.

505
56:35.185 --> 56:37.787
With my sword,

506
56:39.256 --> 56:42.259
I will awaken...

507
56:43.093 --> 56:47.097
the spirit of Goguryeo!

508
56:52.168 --> 56:54.471
(Daeyaseong, Silla)

509
57:03.914 --> 57:05.849
Sir, it is Geom Il.

510
57:08.818 --> 57:10.186
Enter.

511
57:16.426 --> 57:18.028
The minister wishes to see you.

512
57:34.411 --> 57:35.445
My wife?

513
57:45.021 --> 57:46.156
The wife...

514
57:47.223 --> 57:51.328
you said you had thrown out dared to remain within the fortress.

515
57:52.395 --> 57:54.731
You dared to lie to my face...

516
57:55.298 --> 57:57.901
and hide a Baekje woman in my domain?

517
57:59.402 --> 58:00.770
You are mistaken, sir.

518
58:01.204 --> 58:02.906
- I meant... - General.

519
58:12.983 --> 58:14.451
I am at fault.

520
58:16.119 --> 58:18.054
I could not bear to send her away.

521
58:24.027 --> 58:25.962
Every night within these walls,

522
58:27.063 --> 58:31.101
I am driven mad by nightmares of Baekje and its people.

523
58:35.872 --> 58:38.074
And you dare do this?

524
58:40.543 --> 58:41.544
All of this...

525
58:42.345 --> 58:43.747
is my fault.

526
59:24.721 --> 59:26.890
So you are weary of this place?

527
59:31.161 --> 59:34.264
Have you come to finally strip me of my position?

528
59:35.799 --> 59:40.837
Would I have come just to do that, Governor Kim Pum Seok?

529
59:43.773 --> 59:47.110
Silla is facing a critical moment in its history.

530
59:48.511 --> 59:50.547
Losing this fortress will threaten...

531
59:51.147 --> 59:52.982
not only our Queen, but all of Seorabeol.

532
59:53.049 --> 59:55.685
This fortress will never fall.

533
59:55.752 --> 59:59.322
Not a single Baekje arrow has breached these walls!

534
01:00:06.196 --> 01:00:09.566
You should have defended the province with this confidence.

535
01:00:09.632 --> 01:00:11.768
You lost 40 fortresses!

536
01:00:18.808 --> 01:00:22.445
Why did rumors of collusion between Baekje and the Gaya people...

537
01:00:22.512 --> 01:00:25.949
start in the land you govern when they are the people you hate most?

538
01:00:26.015 --> 01:00:27.517
That is nonsense!

539
01:00:45.201 --> 01:00:47.971
Do you think I do not know what you did?

540
01:00:49.038 --> 01:00:51.508
Do you think I cannot see...

541
01:00:52.041 --> 01:00:55.678
how your twisted hatred for Baekje is hurting the people?

542
01:01:03.453 --> 01:01:04.687
Did you refuse...

543
01:01:05.321 --> 01:01:08.358
to send Baek Ryong reinforcements because you hated him?

544
01:01:09.759 --> 01:01:11.161
"Refuse Baek Ryong"?

545
01:01:11.928 --> 01:01:13.396
The beacon was not lit,

546
01:01:13.463 --> 01:01:16.599
and by the time I heard, Sokhamseong had already fallen!

547
01:01:18.601 --> 01:01:22.238
You suffered from Bi Dam's rumors.

548
01:01:23.640 --> 01:01:25.608
How could you say that to me?

549
01:01:27.277 --> 01:01:30.914
Daeyaseong might also have fallen if I had gone to help!

550
01:01:34.184 --> 01:01:38.154
You fail to see what is actually important.

551
01:01:40.657 --> 01:01:41.724
What?

552
01:01:41.791 --> 01:01:45.862
You cannot defeat Baekje with old tactics created by incompetent Jingol generals!

553
01:01:48.765 --> 01:01:49.999
This fortress...

554
01:01:50.967 --> 01:01:53.102
has been ready for a long time.

555
01:01:53.703 --> 01:01:56.272
If Baekje invades, I will eradicate the threat...

556
01:01:56.339 --> 01:01:58.308
by killing every Baekje descendant within the fortress.

557
01:01:58.708 --> 01:02:01.544
We can last a whole year without Seorabeol's help!

558
01:02:04.113 --> 01:02:05.114
So...

559
01:02:06.249 --> 01:02:08.117
you can leave without worry.

560
01:02:11.521 --> 01:02:12.622
Pum Seok.

561
01:02:16.059 --> 01:02:17.894
You mentioned Bi Dam.

562
01:02:19.963 --> 01:02:21.331
He said...

563
01:02:23.299 --> 01:02:25.835
his leg was injured because I did not help him in a battle.

564
01:02:27.237 --> 01:02:30.907
All that man does is blame others and scheme!

565
01:02:34.577 --> 01:02:35.712
The thing is,

566
01:02:37.580 --> 01:02:39.882
I deliberately did not help him.

567
01:02:42.652 --> 01:02:44.754
I hoped he had died that day.

568
01:02:46.256 --> 01:02:47.290
What?

569
01:02:47.357 --> 01:02:49.525
I only care about Silla's future.

570
01:02:51.461 --> 01:02:54.530
I am still deciding whether you are worth saving.

571
01:03:13.349 --> 01:03:15.485
I came here to see...

572
01:03:16.719 --> 01:03:18.755
whether you were still useful...

573
01:03:18.821 --> 01:03:21.190
or if Baekje returned a useless shell of a man.

574
01:03:29.265 --> 01:03:30.266
Listen carefully.

575
01:03:31.501 --> 01:03:34.537
Do you know why I have spoken so harshly to you today?

576
01:03:35.938 --> 01:03:37.740
Any Silla commander...

577
01:03:39.008 --> 01:03:41.511
would have done what you did, even me.

578
01:03:42.345 --> 01:03:44.280
Hatred for Baekje...

579
01:03:45.748 --> 01:03:47.417
can make anyone lose their mind.

580
01:03:54.724 --> 01:03:56.192
It is not too late.

581
01:04:06.102 --> 01:04:10.873
(Kim Pum Seok, Silla's general)

582
01:04:12.275 --> 01:04:13.276
This is why...

583
01:04:14.844 --> 01:04:17.180
I have kept your victory banner.

584
01:04:18.414 --> 01:04:20.283
The Kim Pum Seok I know...

585
01:04:20.750 --> 01:04:23.686
once rivaled Kim Yu Sin.

586
01:04:25.788 --> 01:04:26.956
I still believe...

587
01:04:30.460 --> 01:04:32.662
you can become that man again.

588
01:05:07.130 --> 01:05:09.499
(Sabiseong, Baekje)

589
01:05:15.938 --> 01:05:17.607
I, General Yun Chung,

590
01:05:17.673 --> 01:05:19.876
am ready to go to war.

591
01:05:20.977 --> 01:05:24.480
Give me the order to attack Daeyaseong.

592
01:05:24.547 --> 01:05:27.650
- Give the order, Your Majesty. - Give the order, Your Majesty.

593
01:05:27.884 --> 01:05:28.885
Your Majesty.

594
01:05:51.007 --> 01:05:52.008
(Goguryeo)

595
01:05:52.074 --> 01:05:53.943
Goguryeo has a new ruler.

596
01:05:54.777 --> 01:05:58.481
Yeon Gae So Mun has seized control through a rebellion.

597
01:05:58.548 --> 01:06:00.450
Minister Seong Chung just sent word.

598
01:06:01.050 --> 01:06:02.351
Ko Geon Mu is dead?

599
01:06:06.389 --> 01:06:07.523
Heaven...

600
01:06:08.691 --> 01:06:09.959
has given me...

601
01:06:11.160 --> 01:06:13.729
a chance to destroy Silla.

602
01:06:18.601 --> 01:06:21.971
You want us to join forces and attack Silla?

603
01:06:22.505 --> 01:06:26.709
Goguryeo's involvement alone would cause great confusion in Silla.

604
01:06:26.943 --> 01:06:28.744
If Silla were to fall,

605
01:06:28.811 --> 01:06:31.147
you would benefit a great deal as well.

606
01:06:38.154 --> 01:06:41.891
What is it that you want?

607
01:06:42.558 --> 01:06:44.360
If you could lend us your men...

608
01:06:46.863 --> 01:06:49.532
What would you give me...

609
01:06:51.400 --> 01:06:54.070
in return for my army?

610
01:06:55.404 --> 01:06:59.375
(Great Goguryeo)

611
01:07:05.348 --> 01:07:07.750
- March out. - Yes, Supreme Commander.

612
01:07:09.285 --> 01:07:11.554
March out!

613
01:07:11.621 --> 01:07:12.822
- Yes, sir! - Yes, sir!

614
01:07:26.669 --> 01:07:29.305
Yes, you are right.

615
01:07:29.372 --> 01:07:31.307
Look at you, child.

616
01:07:31.941 --> 01:07:34.443
You look more like your mother every day.

617
01:07:46.489 --> 01:07:49.225
(Sword & Silence)

618
01:07:50.493 --> 01:07:52.828
(Thanks to Cho Seong Ha for his special appearance.)

619
01:08:17.820 --> 01:08:19.288
Do you not hear it?

620
01:08:20.923 --> 01:08:22.491
It is the sound of war.

621
01:08:22.558 --> 01:08:24.627
What? Goguryeo is participating?

622
01:08:24.694 --> 01:08:26.462
Father, it is Daeyaseong.

623
01:08:26.729 --> 01:08:28.431
Daeyaseong is of great value,

624
01:08:28.497 --> 01:08:30.266
but Silla is even greater.

625
01:08:30.866 --> 01:08:32.268
We must go to Dangseong.

626
01:08:32.335 --> 01:08:33.970
My sister is all I want to protect.

627
01:08:34.036 --> 01:08:36.505
Even if it means seizing blood-stained power,

628
01:08:36.572 --> 01:08:38.608
we must set Silla right!

629
01:08:38.674 --> 01:08:41.477
Just say you wish to be king!
